libvsmbr
------------------------------------------
libvsmbr is a library to access the Master Boot Record (MBR) volume system.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libvsmbr-devel-20240505-1bl2
  libvsmbr1-20240505-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvsmbr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvsmbr/archive/refs/tags/20240505.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libvsmbr-20240505-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libvsmbr-20240505-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libvsmbr-20240505-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvsmbr-20240505-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvsmbr1-20240505-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvsmbr-devel-20240505-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libvsmbr-20240505-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libvsmbr)
  /usr/bin/vsmbrinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libvsmbr.README
  /usr/share/doc/libvsmbr/AUTHORS
